{
  "version": 2,
  "pages": [
    {
      "title": "两天的假期",
      "ambience": "room",
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": "01",
          "rect": [
            0,
            0,
            1176,
            202
          ],
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "连续工作了两个多月，我实在累了。",
          "who": "",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.45
          ],
          "source_bounds": [
            1,
            1,
            1670,
            939
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "02",
          "rect": [
            0,
            214,
            750,
            296
          ],
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "主任，我想请两天假，出去散散心。",
          "who": "我",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.36
          ],
          "bubble": [
            0.48,
            0.58,
            0.48,
            0.35
          ],
          "slant": "right",
          "source_bounds": [
            1,
            1,
            1670,
            939
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "03",
          "rect": [
            762,
            214,
            414,
            296
          ],
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "可以。不过，你得再带一双眼睛去。",
          "who": "主任",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.27
          ],
          "bubble": [
            0.03,
            0.61,
            0.91,
            0.35
          ],
          "slant": "left",
          "source_bounds": [
            1,
            1,
            1446,
            1084
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "走廊尽头的眼睛",
      "ambience": "room",
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": "04",
          "rect": [
            0,
            0,
            486,
            242
          ],
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "于是，他带我去拿眼睛。",
          "who": "",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.47
          ],
          "source_bounds": [
            1,
            1,
            1914,
            819
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "05",
          "rect": [
            0,
            254,
            486,
            256
          ],
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "储藏室里，还剩下十几双“眼睛”。",
          "who": "",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.5
          ],
          "action": "cabinet",
          "source_bounds": [
            13,
            13,
            1646,
            914
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "06",
          "rect": [
            498,
            0,
            678,
            510
          ],
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "主任取出一副传感眼镜，递到我面前。",
          "who": "",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.5
          ],
          "action": "take",
          "source_bounds": [
            1,
            1,
            1446,
            1084
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "屏幕另一端",
      "ambience": "room",
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": "07",
          "rect": [
            0,
            0,
            786,
            300
          ],
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "眼睛的主人，是一个好像刚毕业的小姑娘。",
          "who": "",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.37
          ],
          "source_bounds": [
            1,
            1,
            1670,
            939
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "08",
          "rect": [
            798,
            0,
            378,
            300
          ],
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "麻烦您了，真不好意思。",
          "who": "女孩",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.4
          ],
          "bubble": [
            0.07,
            0.66,
            0.86,
            0.3
          ],
          "source_bounds": [
            1,
            1,
            1446,
            1084
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "09",
          "rect": [
            0,
            312,
            470,
            198
          ],
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "她的声音，像穿过那些钢结构的一阵微风。",
          "who": "",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.4
          ],
          "source_bounds": [
            1,
            1,
            1914,
            819
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "10",
          "rect": [
            482,
            312,
            694,
            198
          ],
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "一点都不，我很高兴有个伴儿的。你想去哪儿？",
          "who": "我",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.32
          ],
          "bubble": [
            0.03,
            0.55,
            0.44,
            0.35
          ],
          "source_bounds": [
            17,
            16,
            1413,
            1053
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "不合常理的细节",
      "ambience": "signal",
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": "11",
          "rect": [
            0,
            0,
            370,
            510
          ],
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "什么？您自己还没决定去哪儿？",
          "who": "女孩",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.4
          ],
          "bubble": [
            0.05,
            0.69,
            0.9,
            0.25
          ],
          "source_bounds": [
            1,
            1,
            1446,
            1084
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "12",
          "rect": [
            382,
            0,
            794,
            174
          ],
          "kind": "thought",
          "text": "等等……她的回答，几乎没有延时。",
          "who": "",
          "focus": [
            0.52,
            0.3
          ],
          "source_bounds": [
            18,
            16,
            1412,
            1052
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "13",
          "rect": [
            382,
            186,
            794,
            324
          ],
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "作为航天个人装备工程师，我注意到这套太空服很奇怪。",
          "who": "",
          "focus": [
            0.57,
            0.46
          ],
          "action": "equipment",
          "source_bounds": [
            1,
            1,
            1446,
            1084
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "别问，好吗",
      "ambience": "signal",
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": "14",
          "rect": [
            0,
            0,
            1176,
            228
          ],
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "她在哪个空间站？",
          "who": "我",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.4
          ],
          "bubble": [
            0.04,
            0.48,
            0.3,
            0.4
          ],
          "source_bounds": [
            1,
            1,
            1670,
            939
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "15",
          "rect": [
            0,
            240,
            470,
            270
          ],
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "先别问这个吧。",
          "who": "主任",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.3
          ],
          "bubble": [
            0.04,
            0.66,
            0.72,
            0.29
          ],
          "slant": "right",
          "source_bounds": [
            1,
            1,
            1446,
            1084
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "16",
          "rect": [
            482,
            240,
            694,
            270
          ],
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "别问，好吗？",
          "who": "女孩",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.32
          ],
          "bubble": [
            0.65,
            0.08,
            0.31,
            0.38
          ],
          "slant": "left",
          "source_bounds": [
            1,
            1,
            1446,
            1084
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "没有窗的驾驶舱",
      "ambience": "signal",
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": "17",
          "rect": [
            0,
            0,
            1176,
            166
          ],
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "你不会是被关禁闭吧？",
          "who": "我",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.35
          ],
          "bubble": [
            0.03,
            0.16,
            0.31,
            0.68
          ],
          "source_bounds": [
            1,
            1,
            1670,
            939
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "18",
          "rect": [
            0,
            178,
            738,
            332
          ],
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "舱室十分窄小。仪器闪烁着，却没有窗子，也没有观察屏幕。",
          "who": "",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.47
          ],
          "source_bounds": [
            12,
            10,
            1649,
            919
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "21",
          "rect": [
            750,
            178,
            426,
            332
          ],
          "kind": "thought",
          "text": "一支铅笔，在她身旁缓缓打转……",
          "who": "",
          "focus": [
            0.52,
            0.4
          ],
          "action": "pencil",
          "source_bounds": [
            4,
            4,
            1170,
            1326
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "话语之间的停顿",
      "ambience": "signal",
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": "19",
          "rect": [
            0,
            0,
            1176,
            218
          ],
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "听到我的玩笑，她和主任都愣了一下。",
          "who": "",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.33
          ],
          "source_bounds": [
            1,
            1,
            1670,
            939
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "22",
          "rect": [
            0,
            230,
            390,
            280
          ],
          "kind": "thought",
          "text": "我才意识到，这个玩笑不太合适。",
          "who": "",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.5
          ],
          "source_bounds": [
            4,
            45,
            405,
            419
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "20",
          "rect": [
            402,
            230,
            774,
            280
          ],
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "好，我不问自己不该知道的事了。你还是决定我们去哪儿吧。",
          "who": "我",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.38
          ],
          "bubble": [
            0.03,
            0.6,
            0.43,
            0.35
          ],
          "source_bounds": [
            16,
            15,
            1416,
            1055
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "一次郑重的选择",
      "ambience": "room",
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": "23",
          "rect": [
            0,
            0,
            386,
            510
          ],
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "她双手握在胸前，双眼半闭。这个决定对她很艰难。",
          "who": "",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.47
          ],
          "source_bounds": [
            4,
            45,
            406,
            419
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "24",
          "rect": [
            398,
            0,
            778,
            184
          ],
          "kind": "thought",
          "text": "我不由得轻轻笑了出来。",
          "who": "",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.58
          ],
          "source_bounds": [
            4,
            45,
            406,
            419
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "25",
          "rect": [
            398,
            196,
            778,
            314
          ],
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "哦，这对我来说不容易。您要是看过海伦·凯勒的《三天所见》，就能明白这多难了！",
          "who": "女孩",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.4
          ],
          "bubble": [
            0.03,
            0.61,
            0.55,
            0.36
          ],
          "source_bounds": [
            4,
            45,
            405,
            418
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "带上她的眼睛",
      "ambience": "room",
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": "26",
          "rect": [
            0,
            0,
            742,
            250
          ],
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "我们没有三天，只有两天。在时间上，这个时代的人都是穷光蛋。不过，三小时内，我和你的眼睛就能到达地球上的任何一个地方。",
          "who": "我",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.33
          ],
          "bubble": [
            0.49,
            0.52,
            0.49,
            0.45
          ],
          "source_bounds": [
            4,
            45,
            405,
            418
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "27",
          "rect": [
            0,
            262,
            742,
            248
          ],
          "kind": "speech",
          "text": "那就去我们起航前去过的地方吧！",
          "who": "女孩",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.34
          ],
          "bubble": [
            0.04,
            0.74,
            0.51,
            0.25
          ],
          "source_bounds": [
            4,
            45,
            406,
            418
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "28",
          "rect": [
            754,
            0,
            422,
            510
          ],
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "她告诉了我那个地方。于是，我带着她的眼睛去了。",
          "who": "",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.5
          ],
          "action": "depart",
          "source_bounds": [
            4,
            45,
            406,
            418
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
